OL,4,CRings of Power filming allows Morfydd  
OL,5,CClark to see 'secret bits' of Wales    
OL,6,GActress Morfydd Clark has described    
OL,7,Ghow filming The Rings of Power allowed 
OL,8,Gher to see "all these secret bits" of  
OL,9,GWales she had not visited before.      
OL,11,FThe fantasy adventure is set thousands 
OL,12,Fof years before the events of JRR      
OL,13,FTolkien's The Hobbit and Lord of the   
OL,14,FRings in the fictional Middle Earth.   
OL,16,FClark, who is from Penarth, Vale of    
OL,17,FGlamorgan, was able to see parts of    
OL,18,Fher own country she had not explored   
OL,19,Fbefore while filming the third series  
OL,20,Fof the Amazon Prime Video programme.   
